# Redirects for pages that have moved, served by GitLab Pages.
#
# Zensical has no redirects plugin — it implements search, offline, mike and
# mkdocstrings only. Anything that is not a page is copied verbatim from docs/ to
# the site root, which is how this file reaches GitLab Pages, which reads
# `_redirects` from the published root.
#
# Format: <from> <to> <status>
#
# The tutorial moved out of the docs root into the tutorials/ quadrant when the
# Diátaxis layout was completed. Both the trailing-slash and bare forms are listed
# because inbound links use both.

/getting-started/ /tutorials/getting-started/ 301
/getting-started  /tutorials/getting-started/ 301
